Z||000000||batboy||06-17-2000||05:43 PM||||I've been thinking that these new Grand Am GT cars might make a great donor car for a Fiero. The 1999 and 2000 GTs have 170 HP 3.4 front wheel drive engine with 4 speed auto overdrive tranny. Since that HP is net, it should be rated more in a lighter car. These GA GTs also have 4 wheel disc brakes (gotta be swappable?) and comfy bucket seats. It might be worth looking out for a cheap wrecked one with good mechanical parts.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 06-17-2000).]||||reg||1
