Z||000002||batboy||06-17-2000||08:50 PM||||The GTPs are the supercharged 3800 Grand Prix and probably the same with those Bonnies. Even around here, if it has a s/c unit on it, the price goes way up.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||06-18-2000||01:25 PM||||BB--Why would the 3.4 have more power in the Plastic Fantastic?  I'm sure it would feel like alot more, but it wouldn't actually make more, would it?||||reg||1
Z||000004||batboy||06-18-2000||05:53 PM||||That 170 HP is net, at the wheels. With a lighter car, there is less weight to push. It's confusing, because often we quote gross HP figures which is at the flywheel. Desk Top Dyno figures are gross engine numbers. Net HP is what you see at the wheels and is what is usually quoted nowadays.||||reg||1
